## 4. Mandatory Attribution

Anyone using all or part of **Corex-Xorion**, whether in its original or modified version, must:

- retain the copyright notices present in the code or application where they exist;
- clearly state that the project is based on a fork or modification of the original project, if applicable;
- indicate the name of the original company: **Corex Institut**;
- indicate the name of the original author;
- provide a visible link to the project's official website: **https://corexinstitut.netlify.app**;
- include a copy of this license with any redistribution.

This information must be visible in the documentation, the project repository, or any other location reasonably accessible to users.

